## OpenWorker — https://github.com/andrewyng/openworker
Used at commit `54b4bfd82d75704a4079ecea4f8f622aa152dbde` (MIT).
Copyright (c) 2024 Andrew Ng.

Vendored / extracted (per `docs/plan/openworker-boundary-map.md`):
- `coworker/engine.py` (TurnEngine) — vendored
- `coworker/sessions.py`, `coworker/providers/{base,router,anthropic,openai,gemini}_provider.py` — vendored
- `coworker/mcp/*` transport — vendored
- `surfaces/gui/src/components/*` (React + Tauri v2 UI) — vendored (rewired at the seam: `api.ts`, `App.tsx` WS switch, `itemsFromMessages.ts`, `src-tauri/src/lib.rs`)
- `sessions`, `events`, and non-secret `settings` slices extracted from
