Rejected / rewritten from scratch (do not derive from OpenWorker):
- `coworker/server/app.py` control plane (P0 security: unauthenticated routes, spoofable-Origin WS, `/oauth/callback` CSRF)
- `coworker/permissions.py`, `coworker/risk.py` — replaced by harness risk-class policy

Each vendored file carries a provenance header citing the OpenWorker commit and copyright.

